    "html": "\n  <div class=\"hero-meta\">\n    <span class=\"level-badge\" data-level=\"3\">Level 3 - Intermediate</span><span class=\"time\">25 min</span>\n    <span class=\"chip warn\">Medium</span><span class=\"chip accent\">1D DP - pick or skip</span>\n    <a class=\"chip\" href=\"https://leetcode.com/problems/house-robber/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">LC 198</a>\n  </div>\n  <h1>House Robber</h1>\n  <p class=\"lead\">At each item you either skip it (keep the best so far) or take it (its value plus the best from two steps back): best[i] = max(best[i-1], best[i-2] + a[i]). Two variables, O(n) time, O(1) space.</p>\n"
